  "body": "This change reverts a possibly unintentional change in behavior\nin commit 285b52f that made \"currentColor\" evaluate to opaque\nblack for canvases that are not rendered.  Going back to the\nold behavior, which reflect most current implementations. The old\nbehavior is to make \"currentColor\" evaluate to opaque black only\nwhen the computed \"color\" style of the associated canvas is undefined.\n",
